    text: "- Linux (x64/arm64, glibc), GTK4 ≥ 4.20, libadwaita ≥ 1.8 (Ubuntu 26.04+, Fedora 43+);\n- Node.js ≥ 24;\n- dev packages: `sudo apt install libgtk-4-dev libadwaita-1-dev` (Ubuntu).",
